menu "MQTT link"

    config NET_MQTT_DEFAULT_URI
        string "Broker URI when NVS holds none"
        default "mqtts://mqtt.cckiosk.io.vn:8883"
        help
            Fallback for device/mqtt_uri (KEHOACH 6.2.1). A shipped build
            carries the vendor's own broker here so a unit needs nobody to
            type an address; NVS overrides it for a customer who self-hosts
            and for a bench broker.

    config NET_MQTT_REQUIRE_TLS
        bool "Refuse a broker URI that is not mqtts://"
        default n
        help
            On in sdkconfig.prod. A plaintext URI on a shipped kiosk would
            put attendance records on the wire in the clear, and one wrong
            digit in a port is all it takes (KEHOACH 6.2.1).

    config NET_MQTT_KEEPALIVE_S
        int "Seconds between keepalive pings"
        default 60
        range 10 600
        help
            The broker declares the kiosk dead and fires its will after
            roughly 1.5 times this.

endmenu
